\citation{b15}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Where the Markov priors enter. The baseline (v3) is the model without the orange box. In the in-network variant (Section~\ref {sec:mk-patient}), the patient-history Markov prior $r$, computed from the previous report, offsets the ML-Decoder label queries. In the post-prediction variant (Section~\ref {sec:mk-patient}), the same chain is fused with the probabilities $\sigma (u)$ of a frozen model, together with metadata (Fig.~\ref {fig:hmm}). The label-graph priors of Section~\ref {sec:mk-labelgraph} act on $\sigma (u)$ at inference.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{4}{7}{}{figure.4}{}}
