\newlabel{tab:mk-innet}{{V}{9}{}{table.5}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {VI}{\ignorespaces Post-prediction patient HMM: change in macro mAP relative to the frozen v3 768~px SWA model (E, flip TTA; the E row is absolute). Primary: frontal images with an earlier state ($n = 4{,}061$). Cross-fitted on patient halves, mean over three splits; 95\% CI from a patient-clustered bootstrap on the first split. $^\dagger $: no bootstrap (difference of three-split means). Internal simulation; leaderboard effect 0.}}{9}{}\protected@file@percent }
